async function loadGameMarket(e){const key=String(e?.id||'');if(!key)return;const c=e?.competitions?.[0]||{},scoreboard=firstMarket(c),homeML=marketMoneyline(scoreboard,true),awayML=marketMoneyline(scoreboard,false);if(hasUsefulMarket(scoreboard)&&homeML!=null&&awayML!=null){st.gameMarkets.set(key,{market:scoreboard,source:'scoreboard'});return}st.gameMarkets.set(key,{...(st.gameMarkets.get(key)||{}),loading:true,market:scoreboard||null});const data=await liveJson(`${ESPN_SUMMARY}?event=${encodeURIComponent(key)}&enable=ranks,odds,linescores,logos`,null),market=firstMarket(data)||scoreboard||null,predictor=data?.predictor||data?.header?.competitions?.[0]?.predictor||null;st.gameMarkets.set(key,{loading:false,market,predictor,source:market&&market!==scoreboard?'summary':'scoreboard'})}
